   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Context: 

The Sector Project Digitalisation for Sustainable Development advises and supports the BMZ in implementing a value-driven and people-centered digital transformation. This includes implementing the development policy understanding in the German governments international digital strategy. To this end, the sector project develops and implements innovative exchange and cooperation formats, supports the strategic positioning in the global and European digital ecosystem and the mainstreaming of digitalization in German development policy.</narrative>
